<div class=3D"section" id=3D"s5">
  <div class=3D"section-header cyan">
    <div class=3D"section-num">05</div>
    <div class=3D"section-header-text">
      <h2>Install LangChain &amp; Dependencies</h2>
      <p>LangChain 1.3+, LangGraph, langchain-openai =E2=80=94 the core sta=
ck for this course.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class=3D"code-block">
    <div class=3D"code-header">
      <span class=3D"code-lang">bash</span>
      <span class=3D"code-label">Inside the agentic-ai-course directory</sp=
an>
      <button class=3D"copy-btn">Copy</button>
    </div>
    <pre><span class=3D"cm"># Core dependencies</span>
poetry add langchain langchain-openai langgraph python-dotenv

<span class=3D"cm"># Dev dependencies (testing + notebooks)</span>
poetry add --group dev pytest ipykernel jupyter</pre>
  </div>

  <div class=3D"table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Package</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>langchain</strong></td><td>Core agent framework =E2=
=80=94 tools, chains, memory, prompt templates</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>langchain-openai</strong></td><td>OpenAI model inte=
gration (GPT-4o, GPT-4o-mini) for LangChain</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>langgraph</strong></td><td>Stateful, graph-based ag=
ent execution with loops and checkpointing</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>python-dotenv</strong></td><td>Loads API keys from =
a <code>.env</code> file =E2=80=94 keeps secrets out of code</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class=3D"code-block">
    <div class=3D"code-header">
      <span class=3D"code-lang">bash</span>
      <span class=3D"code-label">Verify installation</span>
      <button class=3D"copy-btn">Copy</button>
    </div>
    <pre>poetry run python -c <span class=3D"str">"import langchain; print(=
'LangChain:', langchain.__version__)"</span>
poetry run python -c <span class=3D"str">"import langgraph; print('LangGrap=
h:', langgraph.__version__)"</span>
poetry run python -c <span class=3D"str">"import langchain_openai; print('l=
angchain-openai: OK')"</span></pre>
  </div>

  <div class=3D"output-block">
    LangChain: 1.3.x<br>
    LangGraph: 1.0.x<br>
    langchain-openai: OK
  </div>
</div>

