<div class=3D"section" id=3D"s6">
  <div class=3D"section-header red">
    <div class=3D"section-num">06</div>
    <div class=3D"section-header-text">
      <h2>Set Up Your OpenAI API Key</h2>
      <p>We use GPT-4o as the model throughout this course. Never hardcode =
API keys.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class=3D"sub">Get Your OpenAI API Key</h3>
  <ol class=3D"steps-list">
    <li>Go to <strong>platform.openai.com</strong></li>
    <li>Sign up or log in =E2=86=92 click your profile =E2=86=92 <strong>AP=
I Keys</strong></li>
    <li>Click <strong>Create new secret key</strong></li>
    <li>Copy the key =E2=80=94 it starts with <code>sk-...</code></li>
    <li>Add billing details if you haven't already (a few dollars is enough=
 to start)</li>
  </ol>

  <h3 class=3D"sub">Create a .env File</h3>
  <p>Create a <code>.env</code> file in the root of your <code>agentic-ai-c=
ourse</code> project folder:</p>

  <div class=3D"code-block">
    <div class=3D"code-header">
      <span class=3D"code-lang">bash</span>
      <span class=3D"code-label">Create .env (macOS / Linux)</span>
      <button class=3D"copy-btn">Copy</button>
    </div>
    <pre>touch .env</pre>
  </div>

  <p>On Windows, create the file manually inside your IDE. Then add your ke=
y:</p>

  <div class=3D"code-block">
    <div class=3D"code-header">
      <span class=3D"code-lang">env</span>
      <span class=3D"code-label">.env =E2=80=94 paste your key here</span>
      <button class=3D"copy-btn">Copy</button>
    </div>
    <pre><span class=3D"cm"># OpenAI API Key =E2=80=94 used throughout the =
course</span>
<span class=3D"var">OPENAI_API_KEY</span>=3Dsk-your-key-here</pre>
  </div>

  <div class=3D"callout red">
    <div class=3D"callout-title">Security =E2=80=94 Add .env to .gitignore =
Right Now</div>
    Before doing anything else, run this command to make sure your key is n=
ever accidentally committed to git:
    <br><br>
    <code>echo ".env" &gt;&gt; .gitignore</code>
    <br><br>
    If you accidentally push an API key to GitHub, rotate it immediately at=
 platform.openai.com =E2=86=92 API Keys.
  </div>
</div>

